            Artist: P.J. Harvey
Song: The Dancer
Album: To Bring You My Love

View tab in "Courier New" lettering.

On the album, the guitar is strummed quite fast and it is easier to play if you place your pick on the last frets of the

fretboard rather than the body of the guitar like you normally would. On her latest live performances however, P.J.Harvey

plays only the intro (if there is one) and the part from "My love will stay till the river bed run dry" until "The man is

gone and heaven only knows" this fast.

